    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d410-a1">

                <pb facs="0638" n="542" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg542"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Decree of the government.</head>
                <p>Manuel Mendez, vice-president of the republic, exercising the executive power,
                    considering that the reasons having ceased for the deposit which the
                    constitutional President made with the vice-president of the executive power on
                    the 10th of May of this year in the city of Sensuntepeque, I decree—</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Only article</hi>. The constitutional President,
                    Field-Marshal Don Santiago Gonzalez, assumes the executive power of the nation
                    from this date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given in the <placeName><placeName
                                type="venue">National Palace</placeName>, at <placeName type="city"
                                >San Salvador</placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-07-09">the 9th of July, 1872</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>MANUEL MENDEZ.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of the Interior</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#small-caps">A. Grimaldi.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
